{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27093236","formula":"C₃₅H₆₂N₇O₁₇P₃S","hill":"C35H62N7O17P3S","elements":["H","C","N","O","P","S"],"composition":{"C":35.0,"H":62.0,"N":7.0,"O":17.0,"P":3.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Myristoyl-CoA"},"descriptions":{"en":"Myristoyl-CoA is a 14-carbon fatty acyl-CoA derivative formed by the covalent attachment of myristate to coenzyme A in a reaction catalyzed by myristoyl-CoA synthetase. Myristoyl-CoA serves as the primary donor molecule for myristoylation, a post-translational modification in which the myristoyl group is covalently attached to the lysine or N-terminal glycine residue of a target protein. Whereas myristoyl-CoA synthesis is catalyzed by myristoyl-CoA synthetase, protein myristoylation is catalyzed by N-myristoyltransferases (NMTs)."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":11966124,"mass":977.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCCCCCCCCCCC(=O)SCCNC(=O)CCNC(=O)[C@@H](C(C)(C)COP(=O)(O)OP(=O)(O)OC[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@H]([C@@H](O1)N2C=NC3=C(N=CN=C32)N)O)OP(=O)(O)O)O","inchikey":"DUAFKXOFBZQTQE-QSGBVPJFSA-N","iupac":"S-[2-[3-[[(2R)-4-[[[(2R,3S,4R,5R)-5-(6-aminopurin-9-yl)-4-hydroxy-3-phosphonooxyoxolan-2-yl]methoxy-hydroxyphosphoryl]oxy-hydroxyphosphoryl]oxy-2-hydroxy-3,3-dimethylbutanoyl]amino]propanoylamino]ethyl] tetradecanethioate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"11966124","atoms":125,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":17.345,"y":0.627,"z":3.59,"el":"C"},{"x":17.254,"y":1.717,"z":2.533,"el":"C"},{"x":15.819,"y":2.145,"z":2.218,"el":"C"},{"x":14.898,"y":1.042,"z":1.686,"el":"C"},{"x":15.379,"y":0.438,"z":0.365,"el":"C"},{"x":14.362,"y":-0.562,"z":-0.193,"el":"C"},{"x":14.848,"y":-1.165,"z":-1.513,"el":"C"},{"x":13.887,"y":-2.206,"z":-2.1,"el":"C"},{"x":12.932,"y":-1.665,"z":-3.171,"el":"C"},{"x":11.908,"y":-0.627,"z":-2.71